            "long_description": "<p>At Hundred, every product is built to help you perform, and if something<br/> isn't quite right, we make it straightforward to fix. Purchases made <br/>directly on <strong>hndrd.co</strong> are eligible for a free return or exchange within <strong>14 days of delivery.<br/><br/></strong>Know more at <a href=\"https://in.hndrd.co/pages/return-cancellation-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://in.hndrd.co/pages/return-cancellation-policy\">our Return Policy</a></p>",
