        "product_highlight_XPhTDN": {
          "type": "product_highlight",
          "settings": {
            "title": "HNDRD Warranty",
            "description": "90 Days Protection",
            "long_description": "<p>Hundred's warranty policy covers only products bought directly from hndrd.co (marketplace purchases like Amazon/Flipkart fall under that platform's own process instead). It gives a 90-day window from purchase date on rackets, bags/kitbags, and shoes, covering genuine manufacturing defects only — a frame that cracks in normal play, stitching failing early, a sole separating without misuse. It excludes impact damage, wear and tear, third-party stringing, and a long list of consumables/small accessories (apparel, strings, grips, shuttlecocks, support braces, water bottles, etc.) that are never eligible regardless of defect. Racket replacements ship frame-only and unstrung, and a replacement product doesn't reset the warranty clock — it just continues the original 90 days from first purchase.</p><p>To claim, you email <a href=\"mailto:support@hndrd.co\">support@hndrd.co</a> with photos and invoice within 7 days of noticing the defect, then ship the item at your own cost to our Bengaluru address for a 3–5 day inspection. Approved claims get a free replacement shipped within 48 hours; rejected ones require you to arrange return shipping within 72 hours or the item gets discarded. Other conditions: claims are non-transferable (original purchaser only), commercial/rental/coaching use may void coverage, and damage from improper storage, heat, or moisture is excluded.</p><p>For more information, refer to our complete <a href=\"https://in.hndrd.co/pages/hundred-warranty-policy\" title=\"https://in.hndrd.co/pages/hundred-warranty-policy\">warranty policy.</a><br/><br/></p>",
